Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 13:11:11 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1048/1259] Workspaces renamed and deleted three ways; selected
 takes moved; drawn player icons
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

1050: a workspace on the left has its menu (the ⋯ or a right-click): open, new
takes land here, rename, delete. Delete asks what becomes of the takes: they
stay unsorted, or move into another workspace, or go to the trash with it
(sparing those that also belong to another workspace, when so ticked). The
place on the left and the workspace in hand follow a rename. "Move to
workspace…" for the selected takes: into that one and out of this one (out of
every other from All Workspaces). Lab ops ws-move and ws-merge.

1051: the player's own drawn icons (after Lucide, ISC): play, pause, previous,
next, like, dislike, star; no ring or plate behind them (Viktor), the icon
itself larger; the same on the Collection's cards, its sheet, the Writer.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
